  {
    "id": "recPcK2mfLRlV3CbX",
    "name": "WorldQuant Quantitative Finance Workshop",
    "date": "2025-04-12T09:30:00.000Z",
    "type": "Workshop",
    "link": null,
    "description": "Greetings from Databased,\n\nWe are excited to bring you a Quantitative Finance Workshop, organised by WorldQuant. The talk will cover an introduction to Quant Finance, a hands-on training session on building models as well as a mini challenge at the end with prizes for the winners.\n\nThe speaker is Mr. Utkarsh C Doshi, a BRAIN researcher, and an IIT Kharagpur alumni.\n\nThe workshop will also cover details of WorldQuant BRAIN and IQC 2025. The International Quant Championship has a prize pool of 100K, with internship and employment opportunities at WorldQuant available.\n\nThe workshop is for anyone who is interested in quant, finance or just wants to know about this field.\n",
    "files": [
      "https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/53/53/1780423200000/sIuq4Xu9N7kGKubkK5Q6RQ/gRORXma4N0UIY-7FZEBKR6UGoijArZUbTkkPIeGeJK7aaVupTDW5z_7n_DiXtlSMwQqhLMpZM3LudW0VpF9aX-yxR7YXlb3TewvsHZCXFcDCnJx5Cc_cNGhL3hsbrM94gUDX2KENZah5qE3yI4lwomdDnGaqQdD_BjVAlmeuI9xF3_04t20Yu5B_CZsFlC56/64CbeMejAw5pVQyAGsraBkT-HB0yckYkWj-RXmlyjGE"
    ]
