  {
    "id": "recDdgr3cL6KDgrdJ",
    "name": "Capture The Flag(CTF)",
    "date": "2025-04-08T16:00:00.000Z",
    "type": "Talk",
    "link": null,
    "description": "Abstract: Awake from stasis, you find yourself in the future, with only your trusty dbdPad by your side. Times have changed — humanity and technology have amalgamated into something quite dissimilar from both. Cyborgs patrol breathing mechanical factories dotting the wasteland. You must restore humanity to its former glory.\nThis new world calls for a new set of skills. You try contacting your former clan, Databased. The TCP request goes through — turns out they were one of the few races that didn't die out (along with Samasya). You are then summoned to receive enlightenment.\n\nBoring Abstract: This session marks the first project showcase of DELTA, where we will introduce the world of Capture the Flag (CTF). The session will include an overview of various types of CTFs, as well as live walkthroughs of interesting problems. Over the summer, we plan to participate in multiple CTF contests as a team. These challenges not only sharpen problem solving and cybersecurity skills but also provide valuable experience for industry. We also intend to host internal CTF sessions during the summer break, where participants will be divided into teams to compete in a collaborative and hands on learning environment.\n\nLink: https://chat.whatsapp.com/Bz19w1fFRw18o1NTgn4fj3\n",
